cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite both the data package and the original
  article listed under references.
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'burigangaamr: Antibiotic Resistance of P. aeruginosa from the Buriganga River'
version: 0.0.0.9000
abstract: Antibiotic susceptibility test results of 50 Pseudomonas aeruginosa isolates
  from surface water at seven sites along the Buriganga River, Bangladesh, tested
  against nine antibiotics by disc diffusion, with a summary per isolate and the zone
  diameter breakpoints used. The data are republished from the supplementary tables
  of Sharif, Amin, Mehbub and Ratul (2024) <https://doi.org/10.2166/wh.2024.270>,
  Journal of Water and Health, CC BY 4.0.
